<view class="page">
 <view class="eyebrow">妥善留存 · 随时安心</view><view class="page-heading">备份与恢复</view>
 <view class="card"><view class="card-title">保存一份修行记录</view><view class="muted">当前数据仅保存在本机。清理微信数据或删除小程序可能丢失记录，建议定期导出备份。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="onExport">导出备份文件</button></view>
 <view class="card"><view class="card-title">从备份恢复</view><view class="muted">从微信会话中选择此前导出的 JSON 文件。校验通过后，可先查看内容概要，再确认恢复。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="onChoose">选择备份文件</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="card"><view class="card-title">备份内容</view><view>{{preview.practices}} 项功课 · {{preview.days}} 个归档日</view><view class="muted">记录日期 {{preview.date}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="onRestore">确认恢复此备份</button></view>
</view>
